  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "FIX SD-Turbo WebGPU 2nd-gen GPU-process OOM crash (\"GPU process died due to out of memory\" -> device lost -> \"external Instance reference no longer exists\"). The tiled VAE decode's break-based partial run left the buffers whose consumers were past the break stranded LIVE (up_blocks.2 conv_shortcut + norm2 = 128 MiB/gen), so the pool re-allocated them every gen and peak GPU memory grew until the browser's D3D12 budget was crossed on gen 2. Fix: return break-stranded working buffers at run end (bit-identical output). Depends ILGPU 4.17.6 + BlazorJS 3.5.25 - heap-view re-attach replaces priming (a detached WASM heap view is re-created on revive instead of pre-grown; also fixes a cross-origin-window SecurityError in the interop tagger). Carries preview.11 (dispatch-elide default-on ~1.9x). Full changelog: https://github.com/LostBeard/SpawnDev.ILGPU.ML/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md",
